       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-HAPTIC-MAGNETIC.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HAPTIC-MAGNET-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MAGNETIC-SNAP-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KEYBOARD-ACTUATE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CONTINUUM-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAPTIC-SEAL-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HAPTIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PHM-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PHM-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SNAP-AND-KEYBOARD.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CONTINUUM-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SNAP-AND-KEYBOARD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MAGNETIC-SNAP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KEYBOARD-ACTUATE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CONTINUUM-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONTINUUM-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MAGNETIC-SNAP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KEYBOARD-ACTUATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CONTINUUM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-HAPTIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PHM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PHM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PHM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PHM-CODE.
